 starts with a prayer, a kitschy video in which he asks for a hand giving the audience a show weâ€™ll never forget, before emerging in a puff of dry ice. Stained glass behind him and twinkling fairy lights all around, itâ€™s half seedy club, half church service as he barrels into Risk It All. Is this show meant to be a spaghetti western or a 50s high school prom? The Romantic Tour bravely asks: why not both?</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/music/2026/jul/19/bruno-mars-review-wembley-stadium-london-romantic-tour">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;-y9L8l5xkC3Bck4MXjaz0B_vcHzuIeyVfSuaMhhZBuUƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;tI_PbApAwWsdo2O47EApukxJpXIUnrITs48kkozTZjEƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;jbwQBcenP9n217CCrJRV-rVvA0e6lyDDERkmO4TFhEYƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;0lMs_ukvCWHGEckHtePny3wQf69mazxOTG7OHbE9xMMƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;yFiyoX9UbF0SGbf5GEwnA1HzK4omJzar0iYs7aSKRyEƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkdtrueƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Wu8Iq_tFQ7mtu64Aix7CCNk6rM9SUBC3MeImv4RiPmMƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;4b0XBfPhFxYdZcthA1D5_FZXVZCYW7Qoo-H_7EtvCSQƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkdTextƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;YyaTKrjmyrFBSvZ_ZL2lzsNgBySfnpU0TOnb6mOc_Ewƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkqSyndicationSourceƒdpairƒhconstant‚db